+==========================
+ Request Comparison Table
+==========================
+
+b=WebBob
+z=Werkzeug
+x=both
+
+
+WEBOB NAME                         write  read  WERKZEUG NAME                      NOTES
+=================================  =====  ====  =================================  ===========================================
+
+Read-Write Properties                           Read-Write Properties
++++++++++++++++++++++                           +++++++++++++++++++++
